# THEORY with the genre's own walk (0.16.27): the next chord is known a chord ahead, so the yellow arrow and NEXT show without a progression set
# by hand; DISCO's circle (its chords a fifth apart) brings secondary dominants, marked V OF THE NEXT
seed 0
wait 1000
press GLO
wait 100
turn PRESET 10
wait 200
release GLO
wait 300
expect genre 10
tap HOME
wait 100
tap HOME
wait 100
expect view 37
spin SELECT -1
wait 300
spin SELECT -1
wait 1500
expect viz 8
wait 6000
expect walknext >-1
shot theory_walk_a.png
wait 4100
shot theory_walk_b.png
wait 4100
shot theory_walk_c.png
wait 4100
